      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Looks a race in two and the draw makes for an intriguing clash. COMEANDSEE (5) made it four from four this time in when leading and dominating her heat last start. Beat main rival BIRDSONG to win the Group 1 Breeders Challenge 2F Final two back but draws outside her this time in. That creates more of a challenge but she has the early speed to go forward again and is unbeaten at the mile. BIRDSONG (1) was only 4m behind COMEANDSEE in that Breeders Challenge final after drawing wide and racing parked but sticking on well. That was her lone defeat in five runs this campaign, all of them at this circuit and distance. Talented and the ace draw gives her a big shot at turning the tables. YOUR SHUFFLE (2) was an eye-catching fourth behind the top-two in that final two back when she drew widest and went back but closed late. Draws low so is worth including along with GUNNAREASON (8) and SHES A SWINGA (11) who both draw wide but come off seconds to the top two picks in the heats.",
